  "title": "Creamy Elote Dip",
  "description": "This Mexican-style creamy elote dip recipe is rich, spicy, and zesty with a combination of grilled corn, mayonnaise, sour cream, jalalpeño, and hot sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
